<title>USA: Allou launches upscale skin product replica.</title>
<headline>Allou launches upscale skin product replica.</headline>
<dateline>BRENTWOOD, N.Y. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allou Health &amp; Beauty Care Inc said Wednesday that it has launched its replica of upscale skin care products through its wholly owned subsidiary, Allou Personal Care Corp.</p>
<p>The new line of products includes cleansers, exfoliates and moisturizers.</p>
